@page "/Privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy</PageTitle>
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>This development sample uses cookies to authenticate you and remember your handle if requested.
    OAuth credentials remain on the server. Profile edits are written to your public Bluesky repository.</p>
<p>Authentication state is held in memory and is lost when the application restarts.
    Replace this notice and configure persistent protected stores before deploying a real application.</p>
